THIRD-PARTY STANDARDS TEXT - STATUS: NEEDS LEGAL REVIEW BEFORE WIDE PROMOTION

cits_validator/asn1/standards/ contains ASN.1 modules taken from the following
specifications. They are included only so that the conformance rule R06 can compile and
decode PDUs. The copyright in these texts remains with the respective standards bodies.

  - ETSI TS 102 894-2 (Common Data Dictionary), ETSI TS 103 301 (infrastructure services:
    SPATEM, MAPEM, SREM, SSEM), ETSI EN 302 637-2 / TS 103 900 (CAM), ETSI EN 302 637-3 /
    TS 103 831 (DENM), ETSI TS 103 324 (CPM), ETSI TS 103 300-3 (VAM)
  - ISO TS 19091 (DSRC data elements) and ISO 24534-3 (vehicle data module)

The per-file origin (standard, version, source URL, SHA-256) is recorded in
cits_validator/asn1/standards/manifest.json.

The vendored files carry no licence or copyright header of their own, and this repository
has not established the redistribution terms of each source (ETSI Forge repository, ISO
publication). Until that is documented, treat the files as third-party material under their
owners' terms, not under the MIT License of this project's own code.

IEEE 1609.2 ASN.1 modules are deliberately NOT included; cits_validator/core/secured.py
reads the COER envelope structure without them.
